## Top-level

| Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `CLAUDE.md`, `AI_RULES.md` | Agent rules (generic + project-specific). |
| `README.md` | Project overview + quick start. |
| `docs/` | This folder — single source of truth for architecture/api/data/flows. |
| `${SRC_DIR}/` | All application code. |
| `scripts/` | Operational scripts (migrations, kb-sync, lint, etc.). |
| `migrations/` | Database migrations. |
| `tests/` (or `${SRC_DIR}/tests/`) | Unit + integration + fixtures. |
| `.env.example` | Placeholder env shape. Never commit a real `.env`. |

