## Naming convention

Inferable from suffix:

| Suffix | Meaning | Lives in |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `*.routes.*` | Route registration | `routes/` |
| `*.controller.*` | Request handlers — TwiML/JSON only, no business logic | `controllers/` |
| `*.service.*` | Business logic | `services/` |
| `*.types.*` | Types and interfaces local to the feature | `types/` |
| `*.model.*` | Data model (one per collection/table) | `models/` (top-level) |
| `*.handler.*` | Event/message handlers (WS, queue, etc.) | `handlers/` |
| `*.gateway.*` | External entrypoint (WS server, queue consumer) | feature-specific |
| `*.client.*` | Third-party service client wrapper | feature-specific |
| `*.spec.*` / `*.test.*` | Tests | `tests/` |

## Per-feature subfolder rule

Every feature under `${SRC_DIR}/api/${API_VERSION}/` has the same set of subfolders. Files live inside them, never at the feature root. See the per-feature `README.md` for the exact rule on this platform.
